    <briefdescription>
<para>Decorator with adaptive smoothing based on input rate of change. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This decorator does not own a heartbeat; it only transforms the value. Wrap it with <ref refid="classevam_1_1_sampled_decor" kindref="compound">SampledDecor</ref> to get periodic output: <verbatim>SampledDecor&lt;AdaptiveSmoothDecor&lt;MyMotor&gt;&gt; a;
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>TMotor</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Base motor class (must implement <ref refid="classevam_1_1_adaptive_smooth_decor_1a1f0abed3b4b0e2efa64cc2037c1ce700" kindref="member">Go(signed short)</ref>) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>tMinTimeConstantTicks</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Default minimum time constant. Default: 1 </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>tMaxTimeConstantTicks</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Default maximum time constant. Default: 15 </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
